<title>USA: Pontiac TIFA, Mich., won by Center Point Hotel.</title>
<headline>Pontiac TIFA, Mich., won by Center Point Hotel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Center Point Hotel Tifa Limited Partnership said it won $1.800 million of Pontiac Tax increment Finance Auth., Mich., tax increment revenue taxable bonds, Series, 1997 with a rate of 9.00 percent.</p>
</text>
